# R-2/PT-25 repro attempt v2: sustained real background load (Firebase
# Crashlytics/Analytics/RemoteConfig/Performance/InAppMessaging + IAP
# billing SDK calls) for an extended CONTINUOUS foreground session — no
# deliberate backgrounding this time, isolating for a genuine spontaneous
# WebSocket drop rather than an expected lifecycle-triggered disconnect.

before each test
  restart the app
  wait until "Quick Add" appears

test "extended continuous foreground session under real background load"
  repeat 15 times
    tap #today_quick_add_250
    wait 1 seconds
    tap #nav_tab_history
    wait 1 seconds
    tap #nav_tab_settings
    wait 1 seconds
    tap #nav_tab_today
    wait 1 seconds
    tap #probe_open_paywall
    wait 1 seconds
    go back
    wait 1 seconds
  see "Quick Add"
